"lighting_block": {

"lighting": "high-contrast cinematic neon lighting with three sources: intense red gel from one side and electric blue gel from the opposite side, sharp color separation across the facial planes, plus a soft low-intensity frontal key just above camera axis, neutral and weaker than the gels, opening eyes, lips, cheekbones and the center of the face without flattening the split; glossy specular highlights on lips and skin from the side gels, deep shadows kept in the folds, ultra-dramatic editorial beauty lighting, no flat even light, no missing frontal exposure"

}
